{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02953","headline":"奉和圣制喜雪应制 · 宗楚客","name":"奉和圣制喜雪应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"飘飘瑞雪下山川，散漫轻飞集九埏。\n似絮还飞垂柳陌，如花更绕落梅前。\n影随明月团纨扇，声将流水杂鸣弦。\n共荷神功万庾积，终朝圣寿百千年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宗楚客","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02953.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02953","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}